@host = http://localhost:5191

### 1. Create a covenant (201 Created). Status is omitted, so it defaults to Draft.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/covenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "documentIdentifier": "3f2b8c9e-6d1a-4b7e-9c55-0a1d2e3f4a5b",
  "clientId": "7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-01-01",
  "periodEndDate": "2026-12-31",
  "monetaryAmountValue": 15000.50,
  "monetaryAmountCurrency": "USD",
  "footnotes": "First covenant"
}

### 2. Same document identifier again (409 Conflict), message in Spanish
POST {{host}}/api/v1/covenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es-PE

{
  "documentIdentifier": "3f2b8c9e-6d1a-4b7e-9c55-0a1d2e3f4a5b",
  "clientId": "7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-01-01",
  "periodEndDate": "2026-12-31",
  "monetaryAmountValue": 15000.50,
  "monetaryAmountCurrency": "USD"
}

### 3. End date equal to start date (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/covenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en-US

{
  "documentIdentifier": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
  "clientId": "7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-06-01",
  "periodEndDate": "2026-06-01",
  "monetaryAmountValue": 100,
  "monetaryAmountCurrency": "USD"
}

### 4. Negative value (400 Bad Request), message in Spanish
POST {{host}}/api/v1/covenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es

{
  "documentIdentifier": "22222222-3333-4444-5555-666666666666",
  "clientId": "7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-01-01",
  "periodEndDate": "2026-12-31",
  "monetaryAmountValue": -1,
  "monetaryAmountCurrency": "USD"
}

### 5. Blank currency (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/covenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "documentIdentifier": "33333333-4444-5555-6666-777777777777",
  "clientId": "7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-01-01",
  "periodEndDate": "2026-12-31",
  "monetaryAmountValue": 500,
  "monetaryAmountCurrency": "   "
}

### 6. Explicit status Active (201 Created)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/covenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "documentIdentifier": "44444444-5555-6666-7777-888888888888",
  "clientId": "7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-03-01",
  "periodEndDate": "2027-02-28",
  "monetaryAmountValue": 2500,
  "monetaryAmountCurrency": "PEN",
  "status": "Active"
}
